	(text "ORIENTATION SENSOR - WIP\nU26: LIS2DW12TR; ST DS11811 Rev 9 pin map.\nVDD pin 9 / VDDIO pin 10: +3V3_MCU; CS / SA0 high for I2C address 0x19.\nC117/C118: local 100n bypass; GND pins 6/8 and RES pin 7 grounded.\nC115: 10u/16V aluminum EEE-FN1C100R; place near VDD pin 9 with C117.\nR102/R103: 4.7k SCL/SDA pull-ups; obsolete ADXL VREG network removed.\nHost connected: SCL P410/K13; SDA P409/R16; INT1 P306/D11.\nWait 20ms after supply valid. Power-cycle below 100mV for >=10ms.\nPending: sourcing fields, pin modes, timing/power/passive qualification.\nSee design/sensor_alternative.md; circuit qualification remains open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
